      "eq": "",
      "page": "",
      "codeRef": "IonisationBox.c:1085 读 previous_ionize_box->cumulative_recombinations → :1277 dNrec",
      "note": "电离平衡要减掉累积复合量：上一红移的 N_rec 是本步电离判据的一阶项。"
    },
