      {
        "id": "transfer_fn->matter_power",
        "source": "transfer_fn",
        "target": "matter_power",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "σ(R) 与 dσ²/dM 都是 P(k) = T²(k)·kⁿ 的积分，T(k) 是 P(k) 的一个因子。",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "backbone": true,
        "levelSpan": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "initial_density->zeldovich_velocity",
        "source": "initial_density",
        "target": "zeldovich_velocity",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "一阶拉格朗日位移由密度场经 k 空间算子算出，两者是同一盒子里的两个字段。；第 1 层 → 第 0 层（跨 1 层）｜同层的第二个上游（多父，不是跨层）",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "levelSpan": 1,
        "crossLink": true,
        "spanKind": "sibling"
      },
      {
        "id": "initial_density->second_order_velocity",
        "source": "initial_density",
        "target": "second_order_velocity",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "二阶位移的源项同样只吃密度场；开关 SECOND_ORDER_LPT_ICS 决定这条边走不走。",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "backbone": true,
        "levelSpan": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "perturb_field->perturb_velocity",
        "source": "perturb_field",
        "target": "perturb_velocity",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "密度场写入之后，同一支计算在 k 空间把它的方向分量接成速度场。；第 9 层 → 第 0 层（跨 9 层）｜跨层且无间接路径：链条上缺中间量（待补，见 crossLevel.gap）",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "levelSpan": 9,
        "crossLink": true,
        "spanKind": "gap"
      },
      {
        "id": "filtered_sfr->mean_sfr",
        "source": "filtered_sfr",
        "target": "mean_sfr",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "同一次环形滤波同时给出滤波场与它的体积平均；平均量供后续 SFRD 自洽修正（avg_fix_term）用。",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "backbone": true,
        "levelSpan": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "gamma_12->q_hii",
        "source": "gamma_12",
        "target": "q_hii",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "电离判据在同一段循环里既定中性分数、又记下逐格点电离光子率。",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "backbone": true,
        "levelSpan": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "recomb->q_hii",
        "source": "recomb",
        "target": "q_hii",
        "label": "",
        "type": "depends_on",
        "directed": true,
        "conditional": false,
        "note": "电离平衡要减掉累积复合量：上一红移的 N_rec 是本步电离判据的一阶项。",
        "sourcePort": null,
        "targetPort": null,
        "surface": true,
        "backbone": true,
        "levelSpan": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "q_hii->mfp",
